". You'll need an EasyRewards account to access most of these deals, but it's free to join. The sale is live for two weeks only. Shop Now at Staples</p></div> <div class="snippet features" title="Up&#x20;to&#x20;35&#x25;&#x20;off&#x20;select&#x20;HP&#x20;printers,&#x20;including&#x20;inkjet,&#x20;laser,&#x20;and&#x20;supertank&#x20;models&#x20;HP&#x20;OfficeJet&#x20;Pro&#x20;9125&#x20;wireless&#x20;all-in-one&#x20;printer&#x20;at&#x20;&#x24;189.99,&#x20;down&#x20;from&#x20;&#x24;309.99&#x20;HP&#x20;DeskJet&#x20;2955&#x20;wireless&#x20;all-in-one&#x20;printer&#x20;at&#x20;&#x24;49.99,&#x20;down&#x20;from&#x20;&#x24;89.99&#x20;K-Cup&#x20;coffee&#x20;pods&#x20;priced&#x20;at&#x20;&#x24;19.99&#x20;each,&#x20;40&#x20;to&#x20;48&#x20;count&#x20;boxes,&#x20;when&#x20;buying&#x20;2&#x20;or&#x20;more&#x20;with&#x20;promo&#x20;code&#x20;Coffee&#x20;pod&#x20;brands&#x20;include&#x20;Dunkin&#x27;,&#x20;Green&#x20;Mountain,&#x20;Folgers,&#x20;and&#x20;Newman&#x27;s&#x20;Own"> <div class="content-section-header">Features</div> <ul class="content-section-list"> <li>Up to 35% off select HP printers, including inkjet, laser, and supertank models</li> <li>HP OfficeJet Pro 9125 wireless all-in-one printer at $189.99, down from $309.99</li> <li>HP DeskJet 2955 wireless all-in-one printer at $49.99, down from $89.99</li> <li>K-Cup coffee pods priced at $19.99 each, 40 to 48 count boxes, when buying 2 or more with promo code</li> <li>Coffee pod brands include Dunkin', Green Mountain, Folgers, and Newman's Own</li> </ul> </div>]]></description>
